> Suspected real F gap: `runtime_progress.py` resets its progress clock on messages and settled inference counts. Continuous useless inference / repeated reads can always count as progress. Existing implementation distinguishes checkpoints from heartbeat, **not useful task outcome progress**. Recommend separate bounded productive frontier observation while preserving activity tracking and never stealing leases/replaying effects.

Need substantiate and clarify “semantic progress” conservatively: do not claim automatic semantic quality oracle necessary. A deterministic repeated/no-new-artifact/no-new-source/no-node-progress detector can report evidence only.

## Current code/evidence reviewed

### Model selection already implemented

